      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place popped popcorn into a large brown paper bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P6DflaH2Z59Q-skB0WoCiSPzjIk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73761-Microwave-Caramel-Popcorn-step-1-057-acd492abe6b44c6abd75b54ac6bfff0f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine brown sugar, margarine, corn syrup, vanilla, and salt in a microwave-safe bowl or dish. Microwave for 3 minutes, then stir until well blended. Microwave for another 1 1/2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IwiOSlC3Nuk6RnQ6I-eNCeXeeyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73761-Microwave-Caramel-Popcorn-step-2-059-9ba941b8e3924fb6b79aa9bdb9383562.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove brown sugar mixture from the microwave and stir in baking soda.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LTHEO6lJiMomRzK7ejRfpmJ47oM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73761-Microwave-Caramel-Popcorn-step-3-B-062-efa8c9dfc70b40b2ad85ba4fd5e85982.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over popcorn in the bag; fold the top edge of the bag once or twice to close, then shake to coat popcorn.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VB0-pYxxOfUEUhKgL9W2Y7y2sQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73761-Microwave-Caramel-Popcorn-step-4-066-350bbadf062847d09b0dab838be7815a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the bag into the microwave and cook for 70 seconds. Shake the bag, flip over, and cook for 70 seconds more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8A93mFl6wo6urSCEwJbm-m4d_wY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73761-Microwave-Caramel-Popcorn-step-5-067-2c7342c26b09414eba3eeb6fa84bfb13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73761/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour popcorn out onto waxed paper and let cool until coating is set, 3 to 5 minutes.",
